 "doc": "NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Bolt 74B-A9B (kits/nemotron-bolt/NOTES.md): GGUF internal name <-> the BF16 release's safetensors key, per block kind ('kinds', the config's llm_config.layers_block_type: one mixer per block). ggml shapes are the HF shapes reversed after 'prep': squeeze (drop size-1 dims), groups:N (reshape [N*k] -> [N, k], so reversed [k, N]), row (a [n] vector as [1, n]), neg_exp (values -exp(x): A from A_log; shape as row). 'stack' entries gather the routed experts experts.{e} (e = 0 .. count-1) into one [E, ...] tensor. 'gguf_only' tensors have no HF key (the NVFP4 per-tensor factor of the shipping quantisation). The vision tower and projector live in the separate mmproj GGUF and are not mapped here.",
